杰森:麦琪,我不是轻率地做出这个决定的,
Jason: Maggie, I did not take this decision lightly.

287
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:54,920
我今天面试了一吨的人.
I interviewed a ton of people today.

288
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:55,900
麦琪:一吨.有多少?
Maggie: A ton. How many?

289
00:16:55,900 --> 00:16:57,800
杰森:四个
Jason: Four.

290
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:05,340
麦琪:哦,那么除了朱莉,其他三个都很胖了.
Maggie: Oh, so that makes Julie and, uh, three very large women.

291
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:08,660
杰森:麦琪,如果我只看样貌的话,
Jason: Maggie, if I were hiring strictly on looks,

292
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:12,020
我应该雇用第二个女人.哦!
I would have taken the second woman I saw. Oh!

293
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,860
麦琪:你今天很快活啊.
Maggie: Well you had quite a day.

294
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:19,500
杰森:我以为我们昨晚决定了我来做这个,麦琪.我幸运地碰到了朱莉,我为什么不要呢?
Jason: I thought we decided last night that I would handle this Maggie. I can't help it if I got lucky with Julie.

295
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:20,000
麦琪:什么?
Maggie: What?

296
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:24,600
杰森:你知道……我以为我找了这样的一个人,你会很开心.
Jason: You know what...I thought you'd be happy that I found someone who's so, so..

297
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,100
麦琪:年轻而又漂亮.
Maggie: Young and pretty.

298
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,000
