Jason: Well clearly I misjudged the way you'd react to Julie.

299
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:33,700
麦琪:算了,杰森.
Maggie: Bingo Jase.

300
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:39,260
杰森:哦.不应该只谈论她长得怎样.
Jason: Oh come on. This can't all be about the way she looks.

301
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,680
她工作的不也很好吗?
Is everything alright at work?

302
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:42,240
麦琪:是的,该是你问了.
Maggie: Well it's about time you asked.

303
00:17:42,260 --> 00:17:45,500
杰森:我问过你了,麦琪.第一次……哦,你是对的.
Jason: Oh I did ask Maggie. The first time... oh. Ok, you're right.

304
00:17:47,440 --> 00:18:20,200
麦琪:杰森,你知道吗,我已经三个月没上班了,接着以前拉下的活.我已经十五年没有这样了.你能体会吗?我两三分钟就会提到孩子,摄影师一边装他的三脚架,一边说"孩子真的太厉害了",于是我开始哭.等我回到家,我被告知不需要我做任何事,我帮不了什么忙.我还发现,厨房的桌子从冰箱那儿向外移动了十一点五英寸.
Maggie: Jason, do you have any idea what it's like going back to work, going back to work three months behind where I started from. Which was fifteen years behind to begin with. And did you realize that the word baby pops up every three point two minutes? The camera man was putting his camera on his tripod, and he said "this baby is sure heavy" and I started to cry. And then I come home and I'm told I don't need to do anything. I'm told things haven't ever run better. And then I find that the kitchen table is eleven and five inches further away from the refrigerator.

305
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,600
杰森:我很抱歉,很抱歉,我没想到你会觉得这么不安全.
Jason: I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I didn't know you'd be so insecure.

306
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:29,840
麦琪:我不是不安全.我已经四十岁了,
Maggie: I am not insecure. What I am is forty years old.

307
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:34,800
体重超出10磅了,而且很累.我不会不安全.
Ten pounds over weight, and incredibly tired. And I am not insecure.

308
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:39,200
