Jason: Sweetheart, come here. I am going to do anything I possibly can to make you feel better.

309
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,000
麦琪:真的?
Maggie: Really?

310
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,120
杰森:当然.
Jason: Of course. I mean it.

311
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:50,240
麦琪:哦,杰森,太好了,
Maggie: Oh Jason, that's so sweet, that's so sweet. Thank you.

312
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:53,120
太好了.谢谢你,我会帮你找个人代替朱莉.
And I'll help you find Julies replacement.

313
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:58,860
杰森:你想让我解雇朱莉?宝贝,这样不公平.
Jason: You want me to fire Julie? Honey that is not fair.

314
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:02,120
麦琪:好的,我只是认为我们可以找到更好的.
Maggie: Well I just think that we can find somebody better.

315
00:19:02,460 --> 00:19:04,860
有些人更有经验,有些人更能吃苦.
Someone with more experience. Someone weathered.

316
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:08,940
杰森:她已经够好了.
Jason: Mr. Belvedere already has his own show.

317
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:13,000
麦琪:我认为我们可以找到更好的,只要我们出的钱高出最低工资.
Maggie: And I think we can do a whole lot better if we pay above minimum wage.

318
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:17,500
杰森:嘿,朱莉的工资已经超出了最低标准一点点.
Jason: Hey, well, Julie gets a little more than minimum wage.

319
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,080
麦琪:一点点.
Maggie: A little more.

320
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:19,200
杰森:两倍.
Jason: Double.

321
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:19,900
麦琪:什么?
Maggie: What?

322
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:27,200
杰森:让人带孩子,我们不可能出得这么少.我想你如果多了解他一点,就会喜欢她.你这样对她不公平.
Jason: We can't be cheap skates when it comes to child care. I think you'll like her if you just get to know her a little bit. You haven't given her a fair shake.

323
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:32,300
麦琪:我希望你不会.
Maggie: And I sure hope you haven't.

324
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:38,100
杰森:是的,麦琪,如果你很坚决的话,让朱莉走.但是你得看着她的眼睛,告诉她她被解雇了.
Jason: Yeah right, Maggie, if you feel that strongly about this, Julie is gone. But you're going to be the one to look her right in the eye and tell her she's fired.

325
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:46,000
麦琪:很好!恶人我来做.
Maggie: Fine! Make me the heavy.

326
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:51,560
迈克:嘿,本,
Mike: Hey Ben, look.

327
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:53,600
看.如果你拉我来这只是为了看新闻里的妈妈,
If you dragged me down here to just to see mum on the news,

328
