Julie: But I may not graduate in two years.

352
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:09,520
我正在考虑更改我的心理学专业.
I've been thinking about changing my psych major.

353
00:21:09,740 --> 00:21:11,500
麦琪:哦,那会是……
Maggie: Uh hu. See well the thing is that I...

