Julie: Journalism.

355
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:13,720
麦琪:什么?
Maggie: What about it?

356
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,380
朱莉:我想换成新闻学.
Julie: Well that's what I'm thinking of switching to.

357
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:19,240
麦琪:很好.回到我的主题吧.
Maggie: Good. Well back to my point. See....

