麦琪:我做的就是那个.
Maggie: Well I did the same thing.

361
00:21:26,140 --> 00:21:26,240
朱莉:真的?
Julie: Really?

362
00:21:27,940 --> 00:21:30,400
麦琪:是的.但是我大一时候还没有,
Maggie: Yeah. But I didn't do it till the first semester of my junior year.

363
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:33,120
在我一接触到新闻学以后,我就被它迷住了.
See after I got a taste of journalism, I was hooked.

364
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:34,480
朱莉:出版还是电视新闻?
Julie: Print or TV news?

365
00:21:34,500 --> 00:21:37,900
麦琪:不,我首先喜欢的是出版,但是我上了电视之后,我开始认为这才是真正我要的.
Maggie: No, my first love is print, but since I've been on the air I'm starting to think that this could really be my....

366
