367
00:21:39,300 --> 00:21:41,000
麦琪:哦,我跑题了.
Maggie: Oh, I'm off my point.

368
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,080
朱莉:对不起,我们可以以后再谈.
Julie: Sorry. We can talk about this later.

369
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:49,280
麦琪:嗯,朱莉,
Maggie: Uh hu. Julie, let me start this another way.

370
00:21:50,620 --> 00:21:53,900
我们还是换一种说法.
See sometimes you can do all the right things on a job,

371
