Julie: Excuse me. That's the soufflé?

374
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:08,540
麦琪:好了.我们现在能忘记蛋奶酥吗?
Maggie: Perfect. Can we forget the soufflé for now?

375
00:22:09,260 --> 00:22:10,480
朱莉:很抱歉,你说?
Julie: Sorry, you were saying?

376
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:11,800
麦琪:我不确信.
Maggie: I'm not sure.

377
00:22:12,340 --> 00:22:16,260
朱莉:你说"你有时候做的很不错,只是因为碰巧你是这样的人" ……你觉得我有可能成为一个好的记者吗,或者其他什么的?有什么问题吗?
Julie: You said "sometimes you can do all the right things on a job, and

378
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:21,540
just because you are who you are, people can.....Ding! Do I have the makings

379
00:22:21,540 --> 00:22:26,700
of a good reporter or what? There's something wrong, isn't there

380
00:22:26,700 --> 00:22:29,100
麦琪:你也有精神病学家的潜质.
Maggie: You've got the makings of a psychologist too.

381
00:22:32,380 --> 00:22:33,720
朱莉:杰森也这么说.
Julie: That's what Jason told me.

382
00:22:33,820 --> 00:22:35,120
麦琪:我想起来了.
Maggie: Now I remember my point.

383
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:37,200
朱莉:关于你的丈夫?
Julie: So this is about your husband?

384
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,780
麦琪:我希望不.我是说不.
Maggie: I hope not. I mean no.

385
00:22:38,980 --> 00:22:41,260
朱莉:他整个时间都在谈你.
Julie: He talks about you all the time.

386
00:22:42,620 --> 00:22:43,480
麦琪:他?
Maggie: He does?

387
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:46,560
朱莉:麦琪这样抱克莉丝,会让她安静.
Julie: Maggie holds Chrissy this way to quiet her.

388
