我想他在你上班之后,真得很想你.
I'll tell you, I think he really misses you now that you're back at work.

391
00:22:56,780 --> 00:22:57,860
麦琪:你认为呢?
Maggie: Do you think?

392
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:00,740
朱莉:我觉得他有一点妒忌.
Julie: Between us, I think he's a little jealous.

393
