麦琪:我也是.
Maggie: Neither did I.

402
00:23:30,340 --> 00:23:31,500
朱莉:我很抱歉,我又换了话题.你想说什么?
Julie: I'm sorry. I changed the subject again. You were going to say?

403
00:23:31,500 --> 00:23:33,100
